OL,3,GNEWSAFull steam ahead hopes for listed
OL,4,Apumping station
OL,5,
OL,6,FA team of volunteers is looking for for
OL,7,Fhelp to keep preserving and improving
OL,8,Ftheir Grade II listed heritage site.
OL,10,FFrom 1901, the Coleham Pumping Station
OL,11,Fhas dominated part of Shrewsbury's
OL,12,Fskyline in Shropshire, with its
OL,13,F25m-high (82ft) chimney and historical
OL,14,Fbuildings.
OL,16,FWhen its chimney was found to be
OL,17,Fleaning, the site, which had been
OL,18,Foperating as a museum, was forced to
OL,19,Fshut in 2022.
OL,23,APub: 23-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
