OL,3,GNEWSAFull steam ahead hopes for listed
OL,4,Apumping station
OL,5,
OL,6,FSince then, the volunteers of The
OL,7,FShrewsbury Steam Trust have been
OL,8,Fworking tirelessly to preserve the
OL,9,Fvintage engines on the site with hopes
OL,10,Fthey can once again welcome members of
OL,11,Fthe public.
